## 📋 Quick‑Start Checklist for Your Stay

| Step | Action | How / Where |
|------|--------|-------------|
| **1️⃣** | **Confirm the hotel address & GPS** (lat 48.14137, lng 17.113571). | Use Google Maps or the hotel’s website. |
| **2️⃣** | **Buy a 24‑hour public‑transport ticket** (covers trams, city buses & regional trains). | Ticket machines at any tram stop; also via the “BTS” mobile app (Slovak public‑transport app). |
| **3️⃣** | **Reserve a time slot for the UFO Deck** (especially for sunset). | Online at <https://www.snp.sk/en/ufo> – pick a 30‑minute slot. |
| **4️⃣** | **Check opening hours for the Castle & museums** (they can change in winter). | Official websites or the “Bratislava Tourist Board” app. |
| **5️⃣** | **Plan a day‑trip** (Devín, Červený Kameň, Pezinok, Modra, etc.) – buy a combined train+bus ticket at the main station. | Use the “Slovak Railways (Železnice Slovenskej republiky)” portal. |
| **6️⃣** | **Download a family audio guide** (available for free on the “Bratislava City Museum” app). | iOS/Android app store – search “Bratislava Museum Audio Guide”. |
| **7️⃣** | **Pack a small “snack‑and‑water” kit** for the walks (most attractions have water fountains). | Re‑fillable bottle + granola bars. |

